{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_08_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_08",
  "title": "搶灘登陸",
  "storyCode": "DH-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "279ce263ef83c352314e94108c670d1f093e28616257b8703a203995607b03c5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "咳咳，聽得到嗎，聽得到嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "親愛的市民朋友們，還有遊客朋友們，是我，坎黛拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "首先，不用太緊張。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "不得不說，老潘喬這一齣完全在我的預想之外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "我怎麼想得到我信任的手下居然一直密謀著奪取我的城市這麼可怕的事呢，這太可怕了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "但是，正如我一開始所說的，這並不是什麼值得驚慌的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "不如說，我要感謝老潘喬才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "老實說，這兩年，我也一直在思考，怎樣才能讓大獎賽變得更加刺激，更加引人注目，更加能讓人從中獲得快樂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "而我一直沒有找到特別好的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "而老潘喬為我找到了，他用自己的行動向我展示了一場更加刺激的大獎賽！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "大獎賽結束了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "不，恰恰相反。就在剛剛那一刻，本次大獎賽進入了真正的高潮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "所有隊伍在此時都將復活，競猜環節將會重新啟動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "盡可能地去阻止那些在城裡鬧事的傢伙們，我知道你們有這個本事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "事情結束後，我會給你們應有的獎賞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "啊，就是你們兩個吧，我的手下們說，你們在剛才幫他們擋住了一波針對我的刺殺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "來吧，請坐，作為對你們的褒獎，你們也在這特等座和我一起享受這場比賽吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "您......是認真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "我當然是認真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "老潘喬知道，在我面前掀桌子的話，他的贏面很小。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "所以他縮在了這艘我交給他保管的船上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "要是我沒猜錯的話，他應該私底下給這艘船加了不少東西，大炮之類的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "但是，如果只是這樣的話，其實沒有那麼有威脅吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "第二輪比賽和第三輪比賽期間，會邀請許多來自各方的權貴上船，讓他們能夠用自己的雙眼體會比賽的樂趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "我懂了，這些權貴的性命才是關鍵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "因為這座城市的運轉需要和這些人打交道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "對對對，現在就不是我想不想解決他的問題，而是那些老爺的手下們希不希望我立刻解決他的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "嘖嘖，陣仗搞得這麼大，結果還是來陰的嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "多半是埃內斯托那小子教他的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "反正如你們所見，現在我能做的事情並不多，但是，實際上他能做的事情也不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "那麼，為什麼不把事情變得更加有趣一點呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "但是這不是會更加刺激他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "他要是真的敢把那些老爺拉出來斃了，我就算把這座城市讓給他又怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你不明白，Missy，他既然想要奪取這座城市去打仗，那終究也是要仰仗那些老爺的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不然他打仗的錢和士兵哪裡來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "真要我說，船上那些老爺裡，恐怕早有幾個和他已經談好的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "哦？你們兩個年輕人很有意思啊，看打扮，不是玻利瓦爾人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，我們來自龍門，現在還有兩個朋友在船上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "嗯？你們兩個竟然是陳世侄和林世侄的朋友？怎麼沒有聽她們提起過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我們沒有告訴她們，是偷偷來玩的，您不知道自然也正常。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "哈哈哈，原來如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "既然如此，我可以多告訴你們一點——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "我將這件事委託給了陳世侄與林世侄，而另一方面，我答應了文月夫人，她們兩人在這裡不會受到任何危險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "你們知道這意味著什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "意味著還不到時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "你很懂啊，東國的姑娘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "如果兩位世侄真的有什麼閃失，那船上的那些老爺們，可就要給可憐的老潘喬陪葬了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "Missy，別怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "來來來，正所謂不打不相識，來，坐，我們好好聊聊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "解決了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "解決了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但是情況確實不妙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "看來，你去對付埃內斯托，我來調查的分工還是太晚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不甘心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "不甘心......但也沒辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "這件事沒那麼簡單，早有預感的不是嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我沒想到會鬧這麼大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你怕了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "怎麼可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你現在在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "某個船艙裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "在你和埃內斯托聊天的時候，我到處走了走，雖然在潘喬開始行動前船上氣氛還算輕鬆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不過在潘喬演講之後，船上的那些船員和水手立刻開始行動了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "現在船上戒備非常森嚴，而且武裝和補給非常充足。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "已經做好了拉鋸戰的準備了嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不過，也不是完全沒辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "怎麼說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "另外，他們把船上那些權貴都關到了一間房間裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這是劫匪很常見的做法......等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "從人質下手吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "看來你也發現了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "即使船上有再多的武器和再多的補給，以及陸地上準備了再多的接應，最多我想也只能和掌控著這座城市的坎黛拉女士打成平手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "一旦時間拉長，他勝算並不大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這些權貴人質才是他的護身符。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "呵，沒錯，這些權貴全都是來自三方政府的大人物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "作為人質，他們能夠起到很好的掣肘作用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不需要很長時間，只需要一小會，只要能讓坎黛拉女士在這段時間裡有所猶豫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "他就能做更多的事，也將有更多的籌碼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "但是，我們只有兩個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "說白了，我並不是很想玩你那種個人英雄主義的戲碼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我來做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "救人交給你，我來幫你分散他們的注意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "也可以。船上應該有那種救生小船，再不濟讓他們跳海就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "然後呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "什麼然後？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你打算救了人就跑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你打算一個人留在船上逞英雄的話，我不攔你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "呵。那就這樣吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "那麼，開始？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "開始吧。對了，電話別掛，保持通信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "嘶......這裡是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "text": "哥哥，你沒事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "text": "你被那個姓陳的打暈了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "啊，對，我想起來了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "現在是什麼情況？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "text": "事情正在按照我們計畫的進行，已經有幾個老爺同意協助爸爸了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "等等，陳小姐呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "text": "她在把你打暈後，好像在船上四處引發混亂，爸爸已經下令捉拿她了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "引發混亂......不對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "拉菲艾拉，你現在快帶人去關押人質的地方看看情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "我恐怕陳小姐現在是在為林小姐創造機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "要是讓她們劫走人質就糟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "text": "但是，哥哥你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "我沒事，快去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "text": "好哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "有個老朋友說過，只有被狠狠捶打過一遍，我才會像過去的她一樣，知道自己那些可笑的執著都不過是些衝動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我到現在也還沒有分清，哪些是可以堅持的執著，哪些是不切實際的衝動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但我想她應該也是知道的，如果因此我就不去做的話，我也就不叫陳暉潔了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "真好啊，陳小姐，你知道自己在做什麼，也知道該怎麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "text": "而我呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "埃內斯托掙扎著爬了起來，搖搖晃晃地走出了房間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
